## Features used in this lab

| Feature | Description |
|---|---|
| **Lakeflow Jobs** (dbt task) | Runs `dbt` commands on serverless compute against a SQL warehouse, with logs and artifacts in the run page. |
| **dbt Core** (`dbt-databricks`) | Transformations as SQL `select` models, connected with `ref()`; `dbt build` runs models and tests in dependency order. |
| **Auto Loader** (`read_files` streaming table) | Incrementally discovers and reads new files as they land. Used in the Bronze layer. |
| **dbt tests** | Data quality checks declared in `schema.yml`. A failing test stops the build; a `warn` test only reports. |
| **dbt contract** | Enforces Gold column names and types and adds a primary key and column comments in Unity Catalog. |

## Learning objectives

- Ingest landing-zone files incrementally with Auto Loader from a dbt model.
- Transform Bronze → Silver → Gold with dbt models, filters and tests.
- Orchestrate the dbt project as a Lakeflow Job and read its results and lineage.
